cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below, and cite the underlying datasets and tools listed in docs/REFERENCES.md."
title: "methylation-clock-eval: cross-cohort evaluation of DNA-methylation aging clocks on public whole-blood 450K data"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-11
license: MIT
authors:
  - alias: "creacentblue"
abstract: >-
  Scripted, rerunnable evaluation of published DNA-methylation aging clocks (via pyaging) on two public whole-blood
  Illumina 450K cohorts (GSE40279, GSE87571), with training-overlap flags, a sample-count audit of GSE87571,
  blood-cell-composition analysis of age acceleration, and a frozen ElasticNet external test. Educational/research
  use only; not a clinical tool.
keywords:
  - DNA methylation
  - epigenetic clock
  - aging
  - reproducibility
